00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:12.530
don't fucking touch me. And just as I said that, I looked just past him and I saw one of the guards

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:19.570
in the woods outside the fence with a camera with a long telephoto lens going click, click,

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:27.010
click, click, click, click, click, click. He wanted me to shake this guy's hand, maybe embrace him

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:33.490
