universal healthcare. Healthcare is a human right. Everybody should have healthcare equally.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.950
But at the same time, I want the government out of my business.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:50.110
We have too much regulation. We are over-legislated. When we have 5% of the world's population and

