get a job, I would have been in the halfway house a day or two and then they would have

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:13.390
sent me home and converted the halfway house time to home confinement. So that was the plan.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:17.550
And he said, okay, I said, I'm trusting you here. And he said, okay, I'll do it.

