I ate as fast as I could and went straight to the phone and called my wife and told her,

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:58.350
in fact, I said on the phone, these degenerate liars, and that's the term that I used,

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:03.710
these degenerate liars were nicked on the deal. She was devastated. So was I.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:11.310
