00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:17.470
And he said, I knew you would be upset. So I was listening to your call to your wife.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:23.070
You called me a degenerate liar. And I said, you are, you looked me in the eye and you lied to me.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:27.390
You knew that they wouldn't approve it, but you didn't want me to write. You're a degenerate

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:31.390
liar, just like all the rest of them. And he said, I could put you in solitary for that.

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:38.750
And I said, when are you guys going to understand? I'm not afraid of your solitary. I don't care.

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:45.950
Go ahead, put me in solitary. Believe me, it's going to be a lot worse for you than it is for me.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:53.630
