00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:32.190
Hello, everybody. I'm sorry I've been out of touch so long.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:37.230
After my last letter, I thought I had come to an understanding with the prison administration.

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:41.790
Stop writing letters from Loretto and be put in for nine months of halfway house.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.710
Nine months would have seen me leave here on August 1, 2014.

