of incarceration. Congress actually mandated 52 days a year, but the Bureau of Prisons told Congress

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:17.900
to go screw itself. The only incentive to behave properly is a negative one, so you don't lose

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:23.100
your good time. You get no tangible benefit from taking any classes taught by prisoners,

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:27.820
creative writing, introduction to Spanish, and history of Western film to name a few.

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:32.460
The only way to actually collect your good time is to either get your GED

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:39.580
to be working on it or to not get into trouble. Everybody with the drug case wants to get into

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:44.780
the drug program. If you're accepted and you had no violence or firearms in your case,

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:49.500
you're sent to the nearest prison that hosts the program and you must complete 500 hours of

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:54.780
classroom work. If you complete the coursework, you can get up to one year off your sentence.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:22:00.700
The pre-course drug class is supposed to be 40 hours. It's actually about 10 hours and is

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:07.420
comprised only of watching episodes of the A&E show intervention. If you're a drug addict and you

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:12.700
come to prison, you have to get off drugs cold turkey, then wait until you near the end of your

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:18.220
sentence to finally get into the drug program. That means you could wait 5, 10, even as long as

00:22:18.220 --> 00:22:24.700
30 years before you get any drug counseling at all. Loretto's so-called education department

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:29.980
scheduled a prisoner-led class last fall called Quantum Physics. Nobody bothered to check

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:34.860
whether the prisoner teacher was qualified to teach a course on Quantum Physics,

00:22:34.860 --> 00:22:41.340
nor did anyone request a lesson plan. As it turned out, the gay prisoner teacher's only degree was

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:46.620
from Ringling Brothers Barnum and Bailey Clown College. The course had nothing to do with

00:22:46.620 --> 00:22:51.900
Quantum Physics. It was a self-help pity party for pedophiles and it sought to help them

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:57.020
expand their rationale of denial with the theme from Rocky playing in the background

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:00.380
all the while. The teacher began the course by chanting,

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:03.980
We're homos and we're chomos. We're homos and we're chomos.

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:10.380
Chomo, of course, being short for child molester. One African-American prisoner who expected to

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:15.900
actually learn something about Quantum Physics got up, shouted, This is fucked up, and walked

00:23:15.900 --> 00:23:22.700
out. Otherwise, it was a very popular class among a certain demographic. I'm not kidding.

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:28.700
Even more worrisome is the situation with pedophiles in general. Despite a recent congressional

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:34.540
research service report to the contrary, there is no treatment whatsoever for pedophiles and child

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:40.780
molesters. Nothing. Indeed, these perverts find a welcoming community of like-minded defenders in

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:45.580
prison like we saw in the Quantum Physics class. They also trade pictures of children

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:51.100
that they cut out of the Toys R Us catalog or parenting magazine, photos of young-looking

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:56.380
18-year-olds in G-strings that they buy from mail order houses that cater to sex offenders in prison,

00:23:56.380 --> 00:24:02.460
and even pictures of other inmates' children. Stolen, of course. Pedophiles move in packs

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:07.180
in prison. They sit together in the cafeteria. They take prisoner-led classes together. They

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:11.740
watch movies together, and they congregate in large groups in the library and the chapel,

00:24:11.740 --> 00:24:15.260
all protesting their innocence and complaining that they're misunderstood.

00:24:16.060 --> 00:24:21.900
My friend, cellmate, and former colleague Dave and I took a prisoner-led Introductory Spanish class

00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:26.700
a few months ago. We quit after three sessions because the class was nothing more than a coffee

00:24:26.700 --> 00:24:32.780
clatch for pedophiles. After one asked, how do you say in Spanish, do you want some candy?

00:24:33.580 --> 00:24:38.220
We walked out and never went back. The Bureau of Prisons doesn't do anything

00:24:38.220 --> 00:24:42.940
to dissuade pedophiles. Indeed, in an event right out of the Twilight Zone,

00:24:42.940 --> 00:24:49.820
the warden sent a memo to all inmates, quote, please join FCI Loretto and the Bureau of Prisons

00:24:49.820 --> 00:24:56.620
as we celebrate the United Nations Universal Children's Day, unquote. The memo announcing,

00:24:56.620 --> 00:25:02.300
Happy Children's Day, said, quote, our Children's Day celebration will be held on the weekend

00:25:02.300 --> 00:25:08.460
of November 30 to December 1, 2013. Materials will be available for each family with visiting

00:25:08.460 --> 00:25:15.260
children ages three to 10, unquote. So we have a facility where pedophiles and pedarasts are

00:25:15.260 --> 00:25:21.580
warehouse, where they get no therapy or medication for their perversion, where they spend all their

00:25:21.580 --> 00:25:26.060
time together exchanging tricks of the trade, and where the warden gives them advance

00:25:26.060 --> 00:25:30.860
warning of a children's event so they can schedule their own visits and be in the

00:25:30.860 --> 00:25:37.500
presence of young children from 8.30 AM to 2.15 PM over two days. You may recall from my

00:25:37.500 --> 00:25:42.860
third letter from Loretto that a prison guard had to move my entire family during a visit because

00:25:42.860 --> 00:25:49.020
that pedarast Schaefer from Philadelphia was leering at my nine-year-old son. I'll say it again,

00:25:49.020 --> 00:25:54.540
if pedophiles must stay more than 1,000 feet from a school on the outside, why are they allowed

00:25:54.540 --> 00:26:00.220
within five feet of my children in the visitor's room? Even though I haven't been able to

00:26:00.220 --> 00:26:04.780
take or at least complete any classes since I got to prison, I have learned a lot.

00:26:05.740 --> 00:26:09.420
Among the things one can learn are how to cook methamphetamine,

00:26:09.420 --> 00:26:13.020
how to smuggle drugs across international borders without getting caught,

00:26:13.020 --> 00:26:17.500
how to steal food from the cafeteria and then cook an entire meal using only a live

00:26:17.500 --> 00:26:22.060
electrical wire and a garbage can full of water, how to make contraband cigarettes

00:26:22.060 --> 00:26:27.180
using chewing tobacco spat out by the prison guards, dried, and rolled with toilet paper,

00:26:27.740 --> 00:26:31.980
how to self-medicate using home remedies and over-the-counter concoctions in lieu of

00:26:31.980 --> 00:26:36.540
real medical care, how to set up a Ponzi scheme and how to defraud mortgage

00:26:36.540 --> 00:26:41.500
companies and the Department of Housing and Urban Development, which was another prisoner-lit class.

00:26:42.620 --> 00:26:46.300
So at the end of the day, I guess I have been educated in prison.

00:26:46.300 --> 00:26:51.500
Maybe I have been corrected. I'm confident now that I'm ready to reenter civilized society.

00:26:52.060 --> 00:26:56.860
Seriously though, this lack of counseling, rehabilitation, and educational and training

00:26:56.860 --> 00:27:02.620
opportunities for prisoners is a long-term problem for society. The country is already home to an

00:27:02.620 --> 00:27:09.580
increasingly large population of uneducated, untrained, unreformed, pissed-off ex-felons who

00:27:09.580 --> 00:27:14.940
are not going to just sit around hoping to win the lottery. Lacking prospects for employment,

00:27:14.940 --> 00:27:20.300
they'll do what they do best, commit crimes. For the pedophiles, they will leave prison

00:27:20.300 --> 00:27:25.900
emboldened by the fact that they spent their entire sentence among like-minded sickos without

00:27:25.900 --> 00:27:32.540
once being challenged about their perversions. The B.O.P. needs to get on the ball. Yours, John.

00:27:34.060 --> 00:27:38.700
Yeah, I'm surprised that I got as much negative feedback on that letter as I did.

00:27:38.700 --> 00:27:44.300
There were a lot of people who told me that as a progressive, I should be ashamed of myself,

00:27:44.940 --> 00:27:51.260
that I don't support pedophiles re-enduring society. And I just doubled down like, no,

00:27:52.060 --> 00:27:58.460
that's not going to happen. Eight days later, I decided to write yet another letter from Loretto.

00:27:58.460 --> 00:28:04.220
I was on a roll. Hello again from the Federal Correctional Institution at Loretto, Pennsylvania.

00:28:05.100 --> 00:28:09.260
On February 7th, I gave my first press interview since the prison administration

00:28:09.260 --> 00:28:13.500
reneged on our halfway house deal. They would put me in for nine months halfway house,

00:28:13.500 --> 00:28:17.260
and I would stop writing letters from Loretto, decline all media interviews,

00:28:17.260 --> 00:28:22.220
and withdraw two formal complaints against staff. As you know from my previous letters,

00:28:22.220 --> 00:28:28.060
that agreement is no longer in effect. And so on the 7th, I spoke at length with Dean Sirigos

00:28:28.060 --> 00:28:33.740
and Dimitrios Tsakas of the National Herald, the oldest, largest, and most highly respected

00:28:33.740 --> 00:28:38.860
Greek American newspaper in the country. We spent more than two hours together,

00:28:38.860 --> 00:28:44.460
and we discussed issues ranging from halfway house time to terrorism, drones, and Afghanistan.

00:28:44.460 --> 00:28:48.620
The journalists had gone through the formal approval process weeks in advance,

00:28:48.620 --> 00:28:52.220
were approved, and arrived during normal business hours as instructed.

00:28:53.660 --> 00:28:57.900
Three hours after the interview ended, I was sitting in the TV room with my friend,

00:28:57.900 --> 00:29:02.060
former colleague and cellmate Dave, when another prisoner approached us and said,

00:29:02.060 --> 00:29:06.780
guys, the cops are tearing up your room. We walked back to our room and sure enough,

00:29:06.780 --> 00:29:11.420
two corrections officers were going through all of our possessions. I thought it was an odd

00:29:11.420 --> 00:29:16.060
coincidence, but I just shrugged. I didn't have any contraband, so I lost nothing.

00:29:16.860 --> 00:29:20.460
The very next night, Dave and I went for a walk around the outdoor basketball court.

00:29:21.180 --> 00:29:25.020
When we walked back into the housing unit, another prisoner approached us and said,

00:29:25.020 --> 00:29:29.660
hey, the cops are tearing you guys up again. We couldn't get to our cubicle because the

00:29:29.660 --> 00:29:34.220
gate at the head of the hall was locked. A half hour later, the COs opened it and allowed

00:29:34.220 --> 00:29:38.860
us back in. This shakedown was different than the previous days, and I should note that

00:29:38.860 --> 00:29:44.060
in the previous year, I had been shaken down a total of three times until the interview.

00:29:44.700 --> 00:29:50.060
My locker door was left wide open. My cellmate's lockers were all closed and locked.

00:29:50.060 --> 00:29:55.180
Photos of my children were thrown all over the floor. My mail was strewn all over my bed,

00:29:55.180 --> 00:29:59.980
and my books were tossed on a nearby chair. I approached the CO and complained.

00:30:00.620 --> 00:30:04.220
Retaliation is one thing, but this was just plain disrespectful.

00:30:04.300 --> 00:30:07.580
Sorry, was the response. We were just following orders.

00:30:08.300 --> 00:30:12.540
My cellmates were also disrespected. This shakedown was very thorough,

00:30:12.540 --> 00:30:18.460
and they had all lost property. One of my cellmates, a 40-ish African American whom I like,

00:30:18.460 --> 00:30:22.300
respect, and consider a friend made an important point. He said,

00:30:22.300 --> 00:30:26.860
don't you see what they're doing? They're trying to make us mad with these shakedowns

00:30:26.860 --> 00:30:31.340
so that we'll turn on you. He imagined a conversation. Let's piss off the big black

00:30:31.340 --> 00:30:34.700
guy so he pressures Kiryaku to stop writing and doing interviews.

00:30:35.580 --> 00:30:38.700
My cellmate urged me to keep up the fight. He said,

00:30:38.700 --> 00:30:42.540
keep telling people what it's like in here. I promise to do that.

00:30:43.100 --> 00:30:46.620
The issue here is not the bother and inconvenience of shakedowns.

00:30:46.620 --> 00:30:49.900
The COs are within their rights to shake us down whenever they want.

00:30:49.900 --> 00:30:53.100
The issue is retaliation and censorship, which are illegal.

